WEBVTT

A1-1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.400 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Select Security in Settings.

B1-1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.676 line:58%,center size:92%
User: Can I discard the old codes

B1-2
00:00:11.676 --> 00:00:12.000 line:58%,center size:92%
now?

A2-1
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.418 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: No. Do not discard them

A2-2
00:00:14.418 --> 00:00:16.236 line:58%,center size:92%
before saving the new recovery

A2-3
00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:16.600 line:58%,center size:92%
codes.

SFX-1
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.345 line:58%,center size:92%
[Two warning sounds indicating a

SFX-2
00:00:19.345 --> 00:00:20.820 line:58%,center size:92%
failed security check]

A3-1
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.061 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Complete the security check

A3-2
00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:24.460 line:58%,center size:92%
again, then confirm issuance.

A4-1
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.295 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Save the new codes in a safe

A4-2
00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:29.402 line:58%,center size:92%
place. Once new codes are issued,

A4-3
00:00:29.402 --> 00:00:31.700 line:58%,center size:92%
